 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Like Father, Like Daughter"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "그 아빠에 그 딸"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"Father, I’ll Be the Emperor Instead.\"\n\nBorn as Alicia, the only princess of the Eastern Empire and the legendary Witch of the White Night!\n\nAt the age of nine, her neglectful father—the emperor—was suddenly killed in battle.\nSince things turned out this way, why not take the throne herself?\n\nBut then…\n\n\"I was wondering who dared to covet my throne, and what an interesting face I see.\"\n\nHer supposedly dead father returns alive?!\n\n\"…It’s a pleasure to meet you, Father.\"\n\"Get rid of her.\"\n\"Wow, what a nasty personality.\nOops, did I just say my thoughts out loud? ^^”\n\nA stubborn father vs. an even more stubborn daughter.\nCan their broken father-daughter relationship ever be repaired?"
  },
